{"id":"427dbff531db1052","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-projective-module.md","title":"Projective Module","display":"df-projective-module — Projective Module","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projective-module","aliases":["58-df-projective-module","Projective Module","58-df-zfc-algebra2-projective-module"],"display":"df-projective-module — Projective Module","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-projective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projective-module"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projective-module</span><span>Projective Module</span><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-projective-module</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projective-module — Projective Module"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"82508b70140c7533\" href=\"?note=82508b70140c7533\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-projective.md\">../batch01/58-df-projective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,P\\in V\">\\(R,P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Projective}_S(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Projective}_S(P,R)\\)</span>（规范投射模谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"82508b70140c7533\" href=\"?note=82508b70140c7533\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-projective.md\">../batch01/58-df-projective.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Projective}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Projective}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（兼容别名谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ProjectiveModule}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ProjectiveModule}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（兼容别名）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{Projective}(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Projective}_S(P,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{Projective}(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Projective}_S(P,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}module\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ProjectiveModule}_S(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Projective}(P,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}module\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ProjectiveModule}_S(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Projective}(P,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Projective modules satisfy a lifting property against surjective module homomorphisms, not an extension property.</li>\n<li>规范上游已用精确三元同态谓词与三元满射谓词给出提升性质；本文件只保留旧名称别名，避免把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_R(M,N)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_R(M,N)\\)</span> 的同态集记号误当作该上游的谓词签名。</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-algebra2-projective-module</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>Free implies projective (over any ring)</li>\n<li>Torsion-free <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neq\">\\(\\neq\\)</span> projective over general rings</li>\n<li>一个模投射当且仅当它是某个自由模的直和因子；这是与提升定义等价的定理，不在本别名原子中重复定义。</li>\n<li>Schur 引理只需 simple module；“simple projective”中的 projective 不是结论成立的原因。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lam, Lectures on Modules and Rings</li>\n<li>Rotman, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-projective.md","status":"resolved","id":"82508b70140c7533","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-projective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-projective.md","status":"resolved","id":"82508b70140c7533","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Projective}_S(P,R)$（规范投射模谓词，见 [[../batch01/58-df-projective.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Projective}_S(P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Projective}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ProjectiveModule}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{Projective}(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Projective}_S(P,R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}module\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ProjectiveModule}_S(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Projective}(P,R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_R(M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neq","display":false}],"bytes":1771,"backlinks":[{"id":"1f6aee9023988355","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9$ and $\\operatorname{Projective}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md]])."},{"id":"a1ff59b2909a8ac7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1003","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-projective-module.md|58-df-projective-module]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["82508b70140c7533"]}